@startuml US_3_2_2_Process
title US 3.2.2 - Carregar role interno após login

actor User
participant SPA as "SPA (AuthService/Layout)"
participant API as "AuthController"
database DB as "PortContext\n(AppUsers, Roles)"

User -> SPA: sessão autenticada
SPA -> API: GET /api/auth/role (with auth cookie)
API -> DB: lookup AppUser by email/sub\ninclude active UserRoles
DB --> API: roles list (e.g., Admin, LogisticsOperator)
alt sem roles ou inativo
  API --> SPA: 403 {message}
  SPA -> User: toast + acesso negado
else roles ativos
  API --> SPA: {roles:["Admin", ...]}
  SPA -> SPA: normalize to admin/operator/agent/authority\nsalvar em localStorage auth_token
  SPA -> User: render menus/autorização
end

@enduml
